*E_NAME			"Sanctuary Guard"


*E_CHAT			"See the place behind you? This is   Kelvezu's Lair! I doubt you will    survive in there!"
*E_CHAT			"Kelvezu is a fearsome monster with  incredible attack power. You're not gonna survive with your current     defense power from the most furious monster ever!!" 
*E_CHAT			"Listen! for now, it's not too much to say that Kelvezu is the invincible one living in the Lair!!"
